---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Chemical Reviews</h1>
			<p>
				Welcome. This site collects my reviews of the chemical literature: critical, referenced
				write-ups that synthesize what the primary literature says about a given topic, rather than
				single-experiment reports.
			</p>
			<h2>What is a chemical review, here?</h2>
			<p>
				A review in this sense is not a rating or a recommendation — it's a survey of published
				research on a specific area of chemistry, aimed at answering questions like: what is
				currently understood, where do different studies agree or disagree, and what remains open.
				Each one is built by reading across the primary literature and pulling the findings together
				into a single, referenced account.
			</p>
			<p>
				Have a look through the <a href="/blog">Reviews</a>, or read more about why I write them on
				the <a href="/about">About</a> page.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
